var/

# Screenshots from the test runs. The written record in docs/testing/results/
# is the evidence that is meant to last — a defect, its cause, the commit that
# fixed it. The pictures are how it was seen on the day, 2,405 of them and
# 320MB, and a repository somebody has to clone before they can install this
# should not carry them.
docs/testing/results/run-*/

